  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "This zone can be placed where a stage or DJ sits, so items can't be placed near or obscure the stage or DJ so we can have items without annoying the guest or performer, so the instance will be less likely to turn items off for everyone if anti items zones were added.\n\nSome instance owners are already turning off items by default, this prevents seeing the full potential of the new feature if most large gathering automatically disable items by default, and ruins the overall need of the feature. By creating zone and areas to prevent items to obscure the players or performers, items will less likely be rejected by the instances' owner, even for a game world having items only spawn in the lobby can make a game world feel less restricted allowing new interactive experiences using items without interfering with the game while players wait.",
